<script>
// 🔥 全局标志：退货弹窗是否打开（用于防止varios输入框抢夺焦点）
window.isRefundModalOpen = false;

document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
    const refundModal = document.getElementById('refund-modal');
    const openRefundBtn = document.getElementById('top-refund-btn');
    const closeRefundBtn = document.getElementById('close-refund-modal');
    const searchInput = document.getElementById('refund-search-input');
    const ordersListEl = document.getElementById('refund-orders-list');
    const detailsPlaceholder = document.getElementById('refund-order-details-placeholder');
    const detailsContent = document.getElementById('refund-order-details-content');
    const processRefundBtn = document.getElementById('process-refund-btn');
    const selectAllCheckbox = document.getElementById('refund-select-all');

    let currentOrder = null;
    let selectedItems = new Set();
    let searchTimeout = null;

    /**
     * Print refund receipt (Vale) using CLODOP
     * Format: 68mm width, left-aligned, matching regular receipt style
     */
    function printRefundReceiptCLODOP(receiptData) {
        try {
            // Check if CLODOP is available
            if (typeof getLodop !== 'function') {
                console.warn('[Refund Receipt] CLODOP not available, skipping print');
                return;
            }

            const LODOP = getLodop();
            if (!LODOP || !LODOP.VERSION) {
                console.warn('[Refund Receipt] CLODOP service not connected');
                return;
            }

            LODOP.PRINT_INIT("Vale - Refund Receipt");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_PAGESIZE(3, "68mm", 0, "");

            let y = 5;

            // 1. Store Name (10pt Arial Bold, left-aligned)
            const storeName = receiptData.store_name || ruiyi_pos_ajax.store_settings?.store_name || 'TIENDA';
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "8mm", storeName);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 10);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 6;

            // 2. Store Address (9pt Arial, left-aligned)
            if (receiptData.store_address) {
                LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "10mm", receiptData.store_address);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
                y += 6;
            }

            // 3. Store Phone (9pt Arial, left-aligned)
            if (receiptData.store_phone) {
                LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "Tel: " + receiptData.store_phone);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
                y += 4;
            }

            // 4. Tax Number (9pt Arial Bold, left-aligned)
            if (receiptData.store_tax_number) {
                LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "5mm", "CIF: " + receiptData.store_tax_number);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
                y += 5;
            }

            // 5. Title "VALE" (12pt Arial Bold, left-aligned)
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "6mm", "VALE");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 12);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 6;

            // 6. Separator line
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "----------------------------");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 4;

            // 7. DEVOLUCIÓN (9pt Bold)
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "5mm", "DEVOLUCIÓN");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 5;

            // 8. Separator line
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "----------------------------");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 4;

            // 9. Order info (8pt)
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "Pedido Original: #" + receiptData.order_number);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 4;

            // 10. Date and Time (8pt)
            const now = new Date();
            const day = String(now.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');
            const month = String(now.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');
            const year = now.getFullYear();
            const hours = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0');
            const minutes = String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0');
            const seconds = String(now.getSeconds()).padStart(2, '0');
            const dateTimeStr = day + "/" + month + "/" + year + " " + hours + ":" + minutes + ":" + seconds;

            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "Fecha: " + dateTimeStr);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 4;

            // 11. Cashier (8pt)
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "Cajero: " + receiptData.cashier);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 4;

            // 12. Separator line
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "----------------------------");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 4;

            // 13. Products header (8pt Bold) - 4 columns
            // Producto (26mm)
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "26mm", "4mm", "Producto");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);

            // Cant. (10mm)
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "30mm", "10mm", "4mm", "Cant.");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 2);

            // Precio (12mm)
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "40mm", "12mm", "4mm", "Precio");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 3);

            // Total (12mm)
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "52mm", "12mm", "4mm", "Total");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 3);
            y += 4;

            // 14. Product items
            if (receiptData.items && receiptData.items.length > 0) {
                receiptData.items.forEach(item => {
                    // Product name (left-aligned, 26mm, auto-wrap)
                    let itemName = item.name || 'Producto';
                    const maxChars = 13;
                    const estimatedLines = Math.ceil(itemName.length / maxChars);
                    const itemHeight = Math.max(4, estimatedLines * 4);

                    LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "26mm", itemHeight + "mm", itemName);
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);

                    // Quantity (center-aligned, 10mm)
                    LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "30mm", "10mm", "4mm", item.quantity.toString());
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 2);

                    // Unit price (right-aligned, 12mm)
                    const unitPrice = parseFloat(item.unit_price || 0).toFixed(2);
                    LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "40mm", "12mm", "4mm", unitPrice + "€");
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 3);

                    // Subtotal (right-aligned, 12mm)
                    const subtotal = parseFloat(item.subtotal || 0).toFixed(2);
                    LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "52mm", "12mm", "4mm", subtotal + "€");
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
                    LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 3);

                    y += itemHeight;
                });
            }

            // 15. Separator line
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "============================");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 5;

            // 16. Total Vale (two columns: label + amount)
            const totalRefund = parseFloat(receiptData.total || 0).toFixed(2);
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "40mm", "5mm", "TOTAL VALE:");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 10);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);

            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "40mm", "24mm", "5mm", totalRefund + "€");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 10);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Bold", 1);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 3);
            y += 6;

            // 17. Refund reason (if provided)
            if (receiptData.refund_reason) {
                LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "Motivo: " + receiptData.refund_reason);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
                LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
                y += 5;
            }

            // 18. Separator line
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "----------------------------");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 4;

            // 19. Footer note
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "Este vale puede ser canjeado");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 4;

            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "en su proxima compra");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 8);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);
            y += 5;

            // 20. Thank you
            LODOP.ADD_PRINT_TEXT(y + "mm", "4mm", "60mm", "4mm", "Gracias por su visita");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontName", "Arial");
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "FontSize", 9);
            LODOP.SET_PRINT_STYLEA(0, "Alignment", 1);

            // Execute print
            LODOP.PRINT();

        } catch (error) {
            console.error('Refund receipt print error:', error);
        }
    }

    // Open Modal
    openRefundBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        // 🔥 设置全局标志，防止varios输入框抢夺焦点
        window.isRefundModalOpen = true;

        refundModal.classList.remove('hidden');
        searchInput.value = ''; // 清空搜索框

        // 🔥 使用多次延迟确保焦点在退货弹窗输入框
        searchInput.focus();
        setTimeout(() => {
            if (window.isRefundModalOpen) searchInput.focus();
        }, 100);
        setTimeout(() => {
            if (window.isRefundModalOpen) searchInput.focus();
        }, 300);
        setTimeout(() => {
            if (window.isRefundModalOpen) searchInput.focus();
        }, 500);

        loadRefundableOrders('');
    });

    // Close Modal
    closeRefundBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        // 🔥 清除全局标志
        window.isRefundModalOpen = false;
        refundModal.classList.add('hidden');
    });

    // 🔥 点击弹窗外部关闭时也清除标志
    refundModal.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        if (e.target === refundModal) {
            window.isRefundModalOpen = false;
            refundModal.classList.add('hidden');
        }
    });

    // 🔥 ESC键关闭时也清除标志
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
        if (e.key === 'Escape' && window.isRefundModalOpen) {
            window.isRefundModalOpen = false;
            refundModal.classList.add('hidden');
        }
    });

    // Search Input
    searchInput.addEventListener('input', function(e) {
        const query = e.target.value;
        if (searchTimeout) clearTimeout(searchTimeout);
        searchTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
            loadRefundableOrders(query);
        }, 500); // Debounce
    });
    
    // Handle Enter key for Scanner
    searchInput.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
        if (e.key === 'Enter') {
            e.preventDefault();
            loadRefundableOrders(e.target.value);
        }
    });

    function loadRefundableOrders(search) {
        ordersListEl.innerHTML = '<div class="p-8 text-center"><div class="inline-block animate-spin rounded-full h-8 w-8 border-t-2 border-b-2 border-red-500"></div></div>';
        
        const data = new URLSearchParams();
        data.append('action', 'ruiyi_pos_ajax');
        data.append('pos_action', 'get_refundable_orders');
        data.append('nonce', ruiyi_pos_ajax.nonce);
        data.append('search', search);

        fetch(ruiyi_pos_ajax.ajax_url, {
            method: 'POST',
            body: data
        })
        .then(response => response.json())
        .then(res => {
            if (res.success) {
                renderOrdersList(res.data.orders);
            } else {
                ordersListEl.innerHTML = `<div class="p-4 text-center text-red-500">${res.data.message}</div>`;
            }
            // 🔥 加载完成后重新聚焦到搜索框
            if (window.isRefundModalOpen) {
                setTimeout(() => searchInput.focus(), 50);
            }
        })
        .catch(err => {
            ordersListEl.innerHTML = '<div class="p-4 text-center text-red-500">Error loading orders</div>';
            // 🔥 错误后也重新聚焦
            if (window.isRefundModalOpen) {
                setTimeout(() => searchInput.focus(), 50);
            }
        });
    }

    function renderOrdersList(orders) {
        if (!orders || orders.length === 0) {
            ordersListEl.innerHTML = '<div class="p-8 text-center text-gray-500"><?php echo ($locale == 'zh_CN' || strpos($locale, 'zh') === 0) ? '未找到订单' : 'No orders found'; ?></div>';
            return;
        }

        let html = '';
        orders.forEach(order => {
            html += `
                <div class="order-item p-4 hover:bg-red-50 cursor-pointer transition-colors" data-id="${order.id}">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">${order.date}</span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-red-600">${order.total}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">${order.customer_email || 'Guest'}</span>
                        <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 text-xs rounded bg-gray-200 text-gray-600">${order.status}</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            `;
        });
        ordersListEl.innerHTML = html;

        // Bind click events
        ordersListEl.querySelectorAll('.order-item').forEach(el => {
            el.addEventListener('click', function() {
                // Highlight selection
                ordersListEl.querySelectorAll('.order-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('bg-red-100', 'border-l-4', 'border-red-500'));
                this.classList.add('bg-red-100', 'border-l-4', 'border-red-500');
                
                loadOrderDetails(this.dataset.id);
            });
        });
    }

    function loadOrderDetails(orderId) {
        // Show loading in right panel
        detailsPlaceholder.classList.remove('hidden');
        detailsContent.classList.add('hidden');
        
        const data = new URLSearchParams();
        data.append('action', 'ruiyi_pos_ajax');
        data.append('pos_action', 'get_order_details');
        data.append('nonce', ruiyi_pos_ajax.nonce);
        data.append('order_id', orderId);

        fetch(ruiyi_pos_ajax.ajax_url, {
            method: 'POST',
            body: data
        })
        .then(response => response.json())
        .then(res => {
            if (res.success) {
                currentOrder = res.data.order;
                renderOrderDetails(currentOrder);
            }
        });
    }

    function renderOrderDetails(order) {
        document.getElementById('refund-order-date').textContent = order.date;
        document.getElementById('refund-order-status').textContent = order.status;
        
        const tbody = document.getElementById('refund-order-items-body');
        let html = '';
        
        order.items.forEach(item => {
            html += `
                <tr>
                    <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap">
                        <input type="checkbox" class="refund-item-checkbox rounded border-gray-300 text-red-600 focus:ring-red-500 h-4 w-4" 
                               data-id="${item.id}" data-amount="${item.subtotal_raw}">
                    </td>
                    <td class="px-6 py-4">
                        <div class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">${item.name}</div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">SKU: ${item.sku || '-'}</div>
                    </td>
                    <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
                        ${item.quantity}
                    </td>
                    <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-right text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">
                        ${item.subtotal}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            `;
        });
        
        tbody.innerHTML = html;
        
        detailsPlaceholder.classList.add('hidden');
        detailsContent.classList.remove('hidden');
        
        // Reset selections
        selectedItems.clear();
        selectAllCheckbox.checked = false;
        updateRefundTotal();
        
        // Bind Checkboxes
        const checkboxes = tbody.querySelectorAll('.refund-item-checkbox');
        checkboxes.forEach(cb => {
            cb.addEventListener('change', function() {
                if (this.checked) selectedItems.add(this.dataset.id);
                else selectedItems.delete(this.dataset.id);
                updateRefundTotal();
            });
        });
        
        selectAllCheckbox.onclick = function() {
            const isChecked = this.checked;
            checkboxes.forEach(cb => {
                cb.checked = isChecked;
                if (isChecked) selectedItems.add(cb.dataset.id);
                else selectedItems.delete(cb.dataset.id);
            });
            updateRefundTotal();
        };
    }
    
    function updateRefundTotal() {
        let total = 0;
        const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.refund-item-checkbox');
        checkboxes.forEach(cb => {
            if (cb.checked) {
                total += parseFloat(cb.dataset.amount);
            }
        });
        
        document.getElementById('refund-total-amount').textContent = ruiyi_pos_ajax.currency + total.toFixed(2);
        
        processRefundBtn.disabled = selectedItems.size === 0;
        processRefundBtn.classList.toggle('opacity-50', selectedItems.size === 0);
    }
    
    processRefundBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        if (selectedItems.size === 0) return;
        
        if (!confirm('<?php echo ($locale == 'zh_CN' || strpos($locale, 'zh') === 0) ? '确定要退款并恢复库存吗？' : 'Are you sure you want to refund and restore stock?'; ?>')) {
            return;
        }
        
        const reason = document.getElementById('refund-reason').value;
        
        const data = new URLSearchParams();
        data.append('action', 'ruiyi_pos_ajax');
        data.append('pos_action', 'process_refund');
        data.append('nonce', ruiyi_pos_ajax.nonce);
        data.append('order_id', currentOrder.id);
        data.append('item_ids', Array.from(selectedItems).join(','));
        data.append('reason', reason);

        // Show processing state
        const originalText = this.innerHTML;
        this.innerHTML = 'Processing...';
        this.disabled = true;

        fetch(ruiyi_pos_ajax.ajax_url, {
            method: 'POST',
            body: data
        })
        .then(response => response.json())
        .then(res => {
            if (res.success) {
                // Print refund receipt (Vale) using CLODOP
                if (res.data.receipt_data) {
                    printRefundReceiptCLODOP(res.data.receipt_data);
                }

                alert(res.data.message);
                refundModal.classList.add('hidden');
                // Optional: refresh page or reset
                loadRefundableOrders(searchInput.value); // Reload list
            } else {
                alert('Error: ' + res.data.message);
            }
        })
        .finally(() => {
            this.innerHTML = originalText;
            this.disabled = false;
        });
    });
});
</script>
</body>
</html>